description.en:
100 Emblem Fragments can be combined into 1 Emblem of the Deadly Wizard.

500 Emblem of the Deadly Wizard Fragments can be combined into 1 Emblem of the Vicious Wizard;

2500 Emblem of the Vicious Wizard Fragments can be combined into 1 Emblem of the Brutal Wizard;

10000 Emblem of the Brutal Wizard Fragments can be combined into 1 Emblem of the Insane Wizard;

We did a great job this time! Loaded a heap of books for the geniuses' ship!

A thick green book with a triangle, "Explorations of June lavatories";

A thick brown book with a triangle, "Unique properties of Coba Plateau artifacts";

A thick green book with a circle, "Zem secret dungeons";

A thick green book with a square, "Flora of Eljune";

A thick brown book with a square, "Gibberling families of Coba Plateau";

A thin green book with a circle, some Historian's journal;

A medium brown book with a square, "Zem people's family values";

A thin blue book with a square, "Asee-Teph extinct species";

A medium blue book with a triangle, "Legends of June tigers";

A thin green book with a hexagon, "The truth about Nihaz's motives".

You can find:

- The First Page from the Great Mage's Diary;

- The Second Page from the Great Mage's Diary;

- Page of the Edict of Conclave;

- Page from The Study of Perfection;

- Paragraph from The Study of Perfection;

- Level 3 Clear Rune;

- Universal Tools;

- Astral Replicators.

- Universal Tools;

- Random offensive potions;

- Random defensive potions;

- Pieces of Spicy Fish;

- Bottle of Bitter Infusion.

If you have one of the items or the ability granted by it, you will not receive it again. Does not apply to consumables or items that grant abilities for a limited time.
